    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Willy on an epic  adventure as he strives to repair his spaceship and continue his  odyssey. Embark on a journey filled with challenges, discoveries and... <i>interesting characters</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7 Dark humour</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is as it seems! Enjoy the childish adventure with some subtle dark humor jokes that you'll come across throughout the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7 Narration</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your adventure, you'll be accompanied by a lovely, caring, and charming narrator who will lend you a hand whenever you need it\u2014until... she gets fed up with everything and starts cursing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7 Unique characters</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the adventure, you'll encounter never-before-seen characters that you'll remember... even in your dreams. \u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
